From: bot-for-go[bot] <199222863+bot-for-go[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 06:51:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Default to PIE on Linux

Use PIE by default on Linux architectures that support internal PIE linking,
without requiring cgo or an external linker. Preserve the existing exe
default for other Linux targets and race-enabled builds, and keep explicit
-buildmode=exe as an opt-out.

Fixes microsoft/go#2236.
